translations.string:
This project file no longer exists:
{path}

It has been removed from the recent-project list.

The last project could not be reopened:
{path}

{error}

For witness “{witness}”, {count} automatically generated IIIF surfaces are no longer selected, have no annotations and are not referenced within this TEI.

Remove them from the document? A dated backup will be kept alongside the TEI file.

IDs (sample): {ids}

The following resource changes were detected:

{changes}

Apply them to the witness panels? The TEI text will not be changed.

The edition includes its parts through relative paths:
{hrefs}

Saved in another folder, it would no longer find them. Copy the parts as well, or save the edition in its current folder.

The stylesheet “{name}” comes with Varians: it is not edited in place.
Varians will copy it into the project: {path}
The scenario “{scenario}” will use this copy.

The stylesheet of the scenario “{scenario}” is outside the project:
{path}

Copy it into the project?
{target}

The scenario will then use this copy. “Open without copying” edits the original file.

The stylesheet “{name}” is part of the TEI Stylesheets: it is not edited.
Varians will create in the project a customization stylesheet that imports it: {path}
Its parameters and templates will take precedence over those of the TEI Stylesheets; everything else will come from them. The scenario “{scenario}” will use this stylesheet.

This scenario cannot run as it is:
{problems}

Save it anyway?
